			(property "Note" "Bidirectional shunt protection. Place on the connector side of any series resistors. Route the GND pin directly to board ground. Intended for SDA/SCL connector protection. Pin 1 (IO1) and pin 3 (IO2) are the two independent channels and are interchangeable."
