			(property "Note" "Four independent bidirectional ESD channels. Place on the connector side of the 100R series resistors. Route GND directly to board ground. Intended for XGPIO connector protection. Pin 5 has no internal connection, needs no routing, and is correctly left unconnected. The fourth device uses only three channels; the unused channel must be marked NC. No external rail capacitor or TVS parts are required. Pinout is the DRL / SOT-563 mapping from TI SLVSBQ8E Rev. E Table 4-1; the DCK package uses different pin numbering and must not be substituted."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
